Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:28.68,Title,0,0,0,0,,《冰川时代》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不管这叫「大寒」或者「冷冻时代」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not call itthe Big Chill or the Nippy era?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.35,0:04:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我们怎么知道这是「冰川时代」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, how do we know it's an ice age?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为四周全是冰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of all the ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连说话也冷冰冰的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, things just got a little chillier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help. Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，孩子，我们走，大伙儿都在走呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kids, let's go. The traffic's moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是，可是，可是，爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, but, but, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说「可是」还轮不到你绝种呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No buts. You can play extinction later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，走吧，伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Come on, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 艾迪在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where's Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.65,0:04:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，他说他马上就要出现一个「进化上的突破」了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was on the vergeof an evolutionary breakthrough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.12,0:04:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，我飞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.09,0:04:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一个突破{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some breakthrough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.36,0:04:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 你走错方向了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look out.- You're going the wrong way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.93,0:04:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这毛象疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你就帮个忙吧 别挡着道妨碍交通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do the world a favor.Move your issues off the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.91,0:05:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我也是短鼻子我就不会那么抢眼了，老弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my trunk was that small, I wouldn't draw attention to myself, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别臭我了我们 都挪了一整天了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break.We've been waddling all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就接着走吧，随大流吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Follow the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们走了就清静了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be quieter when you're gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，他要冻死就随他去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. If he wants tofreeze to death, let him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我醒了，醒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm up. I'm up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都快起来吧，呃？扎克？马歇尔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and shine, everybody.Huh? Zak? Marshall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯蒂？「真菌」叔叔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bertie? Uncle Fungus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都去哪儿了？来吧，伙计们，我们该迁…该迁…迁徙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is everybody? Come on, guys, we're gonna miss the migration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔下我就走了 他们每年都这么干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They left without me.They do this every year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？谁都不爱我了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Doesn't anyone love me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道谁都不关心我这可怜的树懒希德了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't there anyone who cares about Sid the Sloth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，那我就自己走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll just go by myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.75,0:06:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，巨无霸 别随地大小便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wide body, curb it next time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，天，唉唷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, jeez. Yuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信，新鲜绿叶菜 弗兰克，你在哪儿找到的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it. Fresh wild greens.Frank, where did you ever…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.70,0:06:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了，快吃吧 - 是蒲公英？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go ahead. Dig in. - A dandelion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.93,0:06:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还以为都被冻死了 - 就剩下这一棵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought the frost wiped 'em all out. - All but one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,唷，唷，这实在让我太我要咬他的…啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes me so… I wanna… Yuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.87,0:06:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呸 今天我算是倒霉透了我的意思你应该懂吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has definitely not been my day.You know what I'm saying, buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.78,0:06:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直一团糟，你们犀牛的脑袋实在是小，你们知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a mess. You rhinos have tiny brains. Did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是事实，我没有恶意也许我的话你们根本不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a fact. No offense. You probably didn't even know what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,美味呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yummo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是蒲公英呀 一定是最后一棵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dandelion. Must bethe last one of the season.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔？ - 冷静，弗兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl. - Easy, Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他糟蹋了我们的色拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ruined our salad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我错了 那是我错了 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mistake. That was my mistake. Let me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.24,0:07:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别认真，我赔 我赔，这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, seriously, let me take care of this. What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.11,0:07:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是松果啊 噢，老天，我最爱吃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pine cones. Oh, my goodness.They're my favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道好极了，这真…呃，真好吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delicious. That's good eating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可不能让我独享了你们也吃点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't let me hog them all up.Here, you have some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.89,0:07:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道不错吧？祝你们胃口好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tasty, isn't it? "BON APPITITE."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,上吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 假装我不在 - 我是想全速把他撞倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just pretend that I'm not here. - I wanted to hit him at full speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别急，我们「玩玩」他 - 别让他们刺穿我，拜托了，我想活命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's OK. We'll have some fun with him. - Don't let them impale me. I wanna live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.15,0:07:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你走开 - 行了，你就别撒泼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off me. - Come on, you're making a scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.59,0:07:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要把那毛小子戳爆然后就走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just take our furry pinata and go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.49,0:08:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，小子，逃得了今天也逃不过明天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's not them today, it's someone else tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.53,0:08:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我今天不想死，OK？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd rather it not be today. OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我们戳断你的脖子你不会痛苦的，怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll break your neck so you don't feel a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，你们犀牛应该是食草动物吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I thought rhinos were vegetarians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真精辟 - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An excellent point. - Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我们把他杀了之后要吃他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says we're gonna eat him after we kill him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢以杀为乐的动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like animals that kill for pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁爱听就跟谁说吧 - 恰好我就爱听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Save it for a mammal that cares. - I'm a mammal that cares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.31,0:08:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，如果你们俩有谁过得了前面这个坑，树懒就归你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, if either of you make it across that sinkhole in front of ya, you get the sloth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，孬种往前跨一步就死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, you losers.You take one step and you're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在吓唬他们？- 对，这坑不会沉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were bluffing, huh? - Yeah. Yeah, that was a bluff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是蒲公英？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dandelion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 我们胜利了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的眼睛真美 - 快滚下我的脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have beautiful eyes. - Get off my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，你和我，我俩配合默契不如结伴一起去南方吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, we make a great team. What do you say we head south together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊，耶 嘿，跳到我背上来一路放轻松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Jump on my backand relax the whole way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.43,0:09:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇，当真？ - 假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow, really? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你不去南方？季节的变换 迁徙的本能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, aren't you going south? The change of seasons, migration instincts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些挺耳熟吧？- 不，再见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any of this a-Ringing a bell? - I guess not. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.97,0:09:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，多谢帮忙 我自己走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, then. Thanks for the help.I can take it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你象只大号的鼬鼠有种等我们下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You overgrown weasel.Wait till we get down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必一窝蜂地去南方又热又挤的，没意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That south thing is way overrated.The heat, the crowds who needs it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是这样好，你和我两个单身汉在荒野中闲逛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't this great? You and me, two bachelors knocking about in the wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.99,0:10:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，你是想要保镖生怕自己被活吞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you just want a bodyguard so you don't become somebody's side dish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这家伙还真够精明的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a very shrewd mammal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你带路吧先生，你叫…叫啥来着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, lead the way, Mr Big…Didn't get the name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曼福雷德 - 曼福雷德？难听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Manfred. - Manfred? Yuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如叫曼尼忧郁的毛象？曼尼深沉的愁思者…曼尼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about Manny the Moody Mammoth? Or Manny the Melancholy… Manny the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.21,0:10:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再跟着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop following me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.98,0:10:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你有心事听着，你就当我不在 我会闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, so you've got issues. You won't even know I'm here. I'll just zip the lip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.86,0:11:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快瞧啊 那可爱的小宝宝，迭戈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the cute little baby, Diego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把他拿来当早餐一定很美妙 - 没有他怎么能算早餐？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Isn't it nice he'll be joining us for breakfast? - It wouldn't be breakfast without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其因为他爸爸杀了我们一半的同胞，穿上我们的毛皮取暖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially since his daddy wiped out halfour pack and wears our skin to keep warm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,以牙还牙，你看怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An eye for an eye, don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那人知道跟剑齿虎斗是什么下场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's show him what happens when he messes with sabers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知大伙儿，我们黎明进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert the troops. We attack at dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:12:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈，把那孩子带来，要活的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Diego, bring me that baby alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要好好享受报仇那最好是活吞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm gonna enjoy my revenge, I want it to be fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.09,0:12:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，累死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phew. I'm wiped out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.59,0:12:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你用这点过夜？- 嘿，你块头大，你有很多木头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's your shelter? - You're a big guy. You got a lotta wood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是小不点儿 - 所以只要半根{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a little guy. - You got half a stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可…有我的小木棍和我高度进化的脑子 我能生出火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with my little stick and my highly evolved brain, I shall create fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.14,0:12:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看智慧是不是能战胜蛮力你瞧着吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see if brains triumph over brawn tonight. Now, won't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我看见火花了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I saw a spark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.39,0:13:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能不能进来跟你一块挤一挤，曼尼老伙计？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance I could squeeze in there with you, Manny, ol' pal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是去烦别的家伙吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't there someone else you can annoy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友、亲戚或者毒蛇什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends? Family? Poisonous reptiles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.57,0:13:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全家丢下了我 他们不管我自己迁徙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family abandoned me.They just kinda migrated without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去年还要过分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see what they did last year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很早醒来然后绑住我的手脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They woke up early andtied my hands and feet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.95,0:13:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,用田鼠塞住我的嘴并且把洞门堵上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they gagged me with a field mouse, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.85,0:13:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走水路这样我就闻不出它们的气味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Covered their tracks, went through water so I'd lose their scent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,反…反正我也不需要他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… who needs 'em, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样？有家庭吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what about you? You have family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.50,0:13:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，看来你累了我们天亮再谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, you're tired. I see.We'll talk more in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼福雷德 你挪过去点好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manfred? Manfred?Could you scooch over a drop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了哪会这么快就睡着的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Nobody falls asleep that fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈来了，我们撤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Diego. Fall back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:17:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小孩在哪儿？- 在瀑布那儿追丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the baby? - I lost it over the falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.73,0:17:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你追丢了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.07,0:17:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要那小孩，迭戈 - 我能找到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want that baby, Diego.- I'll get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.74,0:17:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿如此 不然的话被活吞的就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better, unless you want to serve as a replacement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去「半峰」山 去那儿会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go up to Half Peak. Meet us there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好把他活着带来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had better be alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,能完成这任务吗？迭戈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we trust you with that, Diego?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看见我肩上的那根毛就说 如果你找别的女伴风流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She picked a hair off my shoulder and says, "lf you have an extra mating dance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少找一个毛的颜色相同的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least pick a female with the same color pelt."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.39,0:17:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想完了 我要成她的盘中餐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought "Whoa. She's gonna go praying mantis on me."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有了配偶 就该对她忠诚，你很幸运了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you find a mate, you should be loyal.In your case, grateful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你给我走开 - 一辈子守着一个太蠢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now get away from me.- I think mating for life is stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也太亏了我这「能干」的希德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's plenty of Sid to go around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.50,0:18:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快瞧啊，他没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that. He's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈妈不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是不是忘了什么？ - 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Manny, are you forgetting something? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可你刚救了他 - 上次救的那个我还没甩掉呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But you just saved him. - I'm trying to get rid of the last thing I saved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.36,0:19:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把他留在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't leave him here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧，有烟 他的那群人在山上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there's smoke.That's his herd right up the hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们把他送回去 - 我跟你说白了吧，根本没有「我们」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should return him. - Let's get this straight. There is no "we."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.74,0:20:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来就没有「我们」，其实没有我，这会我连「你」都没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There never was a "we". In fact, without me, there wouldn't even be a "you".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.31,0:20:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是去山上 - 你给我仔细听好，我就是不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just up the hill. - Listen very carefully: I'm not going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.45,0:20:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行啊，做你的混球，我会照顾他的 - 好，太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine, be a jerk. I'll take care of him. - Yeah, that's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连自己都照顾不了 我倒要瞧瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't even take care of yourself.This, I gotta see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送你回去我们不需要那坏蛋毛象，对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll return you. We don't need that meany-Weeny mammoth, do we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.93,0:20:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真给大自然丢脸 这你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an embarrassment to nature.Do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,小菜一碟，我行，我行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is cake. I'm fine, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会送命的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.65,0:21:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那小东西是我的 - 不对，这小东西是我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That pink thing is mine.- No. Actually, that pink thing belongs to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们」？ 你们「小俩口」真是绝配啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Us"? You two are a bit of an odd couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有「我们」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no "us."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.35,0:21:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了自己生不出，所以领养一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. Can't have one of your own, so you want to adopt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，搅了你吃「点心」 可我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry to interrupt your snack, but we gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃小孩？得了，我是要把他送回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby? Please.I was returning him to his herd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.62,0:21:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，行呀，真有你的 「龅牙」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Nice try, bucktooth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.83,0:21:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说我在撒谎？ - 我没这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calling me a liar? - I didn't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.00,0:22:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这么想的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were thinking it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这家伙 他猜透我心思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like this cat. He reads minds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.34,0:22:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫迭戈，朋友 - 曼福雷德，我不是你朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Name's Diego, friend. - Manfred, and I'm not your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，别白费劲找人类了 他们今天早上走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, Manfred. If you're looking for the humans, you're wasting your time. They left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的建议，现在滚吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the advice. Now beat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我帮你把他送回去 但你得保证完事后不缠着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you bring it to its herd, but leave me alone after that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.79,0:22:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧，说定了，你哪儿不对劲？- 全都因为你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. OK, deal. What's your problem? - You are my problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是因为太紧张，所以你吃那么多注意减肥就不会胖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're stressed, so you eat too much.It's hard to get fat on a vegan diet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不胖，是因为这毛皮让我显得…臃肿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not fat. It's all this fur.It makes me look poofy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，那你有「肥毛」 如果有烦心事想说，我听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you have fat hair.But when you're ready to talk, I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.17,0:22:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛？把他放在岩脊上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Just drop it on the ledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.61,0:22:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该保证他们能看见 - 好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should make sure they found him. - Good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.95,0:22:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，等等，等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Wait, wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.48,0:22:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 别…刺我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't spear me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.02,0:23:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这下麻烦了 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a problem. - Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.93,0:23:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，这下可好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.49,0:23:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说过他们都走了 - 瞧谁来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you they were gone.- Look who it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.13,0:23:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到弱小的动物让你开膛破肚了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you have some poor animal to disembowel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.93,0:23:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，他们走不远的，往这边走了 或…这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They couldn't be far. I mean, they went this way, or this way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.87,0:23:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不太懂追踪，对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know much about tracking, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.34,0:23:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我是树懒，看见树就吃叶子，我管这叫「追踪」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a sloth. I see a tree, eat a leaf. That's my tracking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.27,0:23:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没走多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't miss them by much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.61,0:23:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还青着两小时前，往北去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still green.They headed north two hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.31,0:24:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还青着两小时前，往北去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still green.They headed north two hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.85,0:24:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不用这么折腾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need this aggravation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.49,0:24:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把孩子给我 我能比你们更快找到人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the baby. I can track humans down a lot faster than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.43,0:24:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个热情相助的好公民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're just a good citizen helping out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.23,0:24:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道人类去哪儿了 - 冰川道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just know where the humans are going. - Glacier Pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.83,0:24:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都知道他们在另一边有个居住地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody knows they havea settlement on the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.37,0:24:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不懂追踪，在大雪封住通道前就找不到他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you know how to track, you'll never reach them before snow closes the pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.48,0:24:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雪封路可能…是明天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which should be, like, tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.65,0:24:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以，要么把孩子给我 要么在暴风雪中迷路，你们选择吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you can give that baby to me, or go get lost in a blizzard. It's your choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.13,0:24:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱着你的心肝宝贝 我们把他还给人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your little bundle of joy.We're returning it to the humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.53,0:24:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大坏蛋「老虎叔叔」被我们扔下不管了，可怜的「老虎叔叔」 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big, bad tigey-Wigey gets left behind.Poor tigey-Wigey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.17,0:24:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德，「老虎叔叔」负责带路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid, tigey-Wigey is gonna lead the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.57,0:25:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼我能不能跟你谈谈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny, can I talk to you for a second?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.24,0:25:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我们早点找到人类，我就能早点摆脱这流口水的臭家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. The sooner we find the humans, the sooner I get rid of Mr Stinky Drool-Face, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.15,0:25:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the baby, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.75,0:25:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,「金刚巨象」不会时刻保护你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't always have Jumbo around to protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.49,0:25:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪天你没了保护，我劝你最好小心点，因为我会偷袭你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when that day comes, I suggest you watch your back, cos I'll be chewing on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.23,0:25:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「追踪大师」，到前面来，好让我看见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nier-Tracker. Up front, where I can see you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.10,0:25:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.45,0:25:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别让他再哭了 我再也受不了了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta make it stop.I can't take it anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.32,0:25:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没他这么会闹的 我也吃过 - 他不停扭动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've eaten things that complained less. - He won't stop squirming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.52,0:25:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心他的头 - 你把他放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch its head. - Put it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.76,0:25:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,唏，「抱起来，放下他…」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, "pick him up, put him down…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的鼻子是干的 - 那他一定是生病了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Its nose is dry. - That means something's wrong with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.97,0:25:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁来给他舔舔 - 以防万一我来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone should lick it. - Just in case. I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.07,0:26:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他包着尿布呢 - 怎么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's wearing one of those baby thingies. - So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.60,0:26:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他拉屎，就拉尿布里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if he poops, where does it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.71,0:26:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 人类真是恶心 - 好吧你，检查大便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Humans are disgusting. - OK, you. Check for poop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.81,0:26:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，凭什么让我检查？- 因为是你要送他回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why am I the poop-Checker? - Returning him was your idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.15,0:26:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你无足轻重 因为你不检查我就揍你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're small and insignificant, and I'll pummel you if you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.69,0:26:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有吗？- 快 希德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why else? - Now, Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.86,0:26:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈呀 小心，过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, my goodness.Look out. Coming through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.10,0:26:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 别拿它晃来晃去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch out. - Stop waving that thing around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.07,0:26:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜，我要滑倒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna slip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.24,0:26:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是干净的，你上当了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clean. Got ya!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.75,0:26:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别胡闹行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you cut it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.68,0:26:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，再来，他喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do that again. He likes it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.66,0:26:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也觉得爽多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's making me feel better too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.89,0:26:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,给，你来抱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, you hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.53,0:27:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了，让他脸朝我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn him towards me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.54,0:27:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.84,0:27:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.11,0:27:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.51,0:27:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.88,0:27:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 你吓坏他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. You're scaring him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.49,0:27:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他一定是饿了 - 该吃奶了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I bet he's hungry. - How about some milk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱吃奶 - 不是你吃 是孩子吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd love some. - Not you. The baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.13,0:27:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没有奶水给他喝，伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I aingt exactly lactating right now, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.86,0:27:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这食物链底层的没资格顶嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a little low on the food chain to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.67,0:27:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 够了 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough, enough, enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.74,0:27:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吃的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.05,0:27:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，可我听说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but I've been told{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.82,0:27:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，可我听说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but I've been told{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.05,0:27:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日会很冷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of the world be mighty cold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.95,0:28:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日会很冷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of the world be mighty cold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.66,0:28:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为冰川时代作准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for the lce age!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.13,0:28:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护渡渡鸟的生活方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect the dodo way of life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.73,0:28:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,渡渡鸟的生存能力胜过其他动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival separates the dodos from the beasts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.07,0:28:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护渡渡鸟的生活方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect the dodo way of life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.80,0:28:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为冰川时代做准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for the lce age!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.21,0:28:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冰川时代？- 我听说过这些疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ice age? - I've heard of these crackpots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.11,0:28:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有闯入者 - 别掉进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lntruders. - Now, don't fall in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.72,0:28:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 掉进去，就一定会… - 有闯…闯入者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you do, you will definitely… - Intruders. Intruder…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.52,0:28:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,被烫死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Burn and die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.56,0:28:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把西瓜给我们吗？ 小家伙饿坏了，他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we have our melon back?Junior's hungry and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.86,0:28:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 这是我们为冰川时代存下的储备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. This is our privates tockpile for the lce age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.30,0:28:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那个时候我们就要在地下住好几十亿年呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subarctic temperatures will force us underground for a billion years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.47,0:28:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只存三只西瓜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got three melons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.07,0:28:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们事先不好好作准备 那就死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you weren't smart enough to plan ahead, then doom on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,死定了，死定了，死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doom on you. Doom on you. Doom on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.98,0:28:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别过来 - 死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get away from me. - Doom on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.85,0:29:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不，不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.52,0:29:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺回那西瓜 跆…跆拳道准备 进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retrieve the melon.Tae kwon dodos, attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.80,0:29:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 西瓜 - 西瓜 西瓜 西瓜…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The melon. - The melon, the melon, the melon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.14,0:29:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一个「女同胞」也完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There goes our last female.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.02,0:29:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抢到了，抢到了 抢到了 - 又没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it, got it, got it. - Don't got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.52,0:29:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的西瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last melon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.64,0:31:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德 还得再找吃的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid. Now we gotta find more food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.18,0:31:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,再往右一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, more to the right. Right, right, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.29,0:31:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚餐还有表演看不 - 左，左，左，不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at that. Dinner and a show. - Left, left, left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.90,0:31:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该找份象样的大餐犒劳胜利英雄了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now to find a meal befitting a conquering hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.47,0:31:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？ 敌人？来吧，想跟我干一架吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What ho? A foe? Come on, come on. You want a piece of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.51,0:31:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这战利品值得我为它好好…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoils worthy of such a noble…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.72,0:31:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,该睡了，小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bedtime, squirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯旋归来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The triumphant return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.90,0:32:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃？ 噢，那是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Oh, that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.37,0:32:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃饱了 该亲亲这个小朋友说晚安了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so full. How about a good-Night kiss for your big buddy, Sid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.51,0:32:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他睡着了 - 我是在跟你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's asleep. - I was talking to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.51,0:32:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了，我自己睡吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, I'll tuck myself in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.96,0:32:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.62,0:32:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吵了行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stop it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.15,0:32:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，好吧，我是想放松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. I was trying to relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.56,0:33:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎唷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.88,0:33:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞什么… - 朝我上呀，看我不把你撕碎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the…? - Slice me. It'll be the last thing you ever do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.31,0:34:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在办事，你这饭桶 - 很郁闷吧，迭戈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm working here, you waste of fur.- Frustrated, Diego?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.98,0:34:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个小不点婴儿对你来说太难了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracking down helpless infants too difficult for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.09,0:34:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们俩来这干嘛？- 索托已经等得不耐烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you two doing here? - Soto's getting tired of waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.51,0:34:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说要么带着小孩回来 要么就别回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he said "Come back with the baby, or don't come back at all."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.10,0:34:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我捎个信给索托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a message for Soto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.50,0:34:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他…我会带孩子来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I'm bringing the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.24,0:34:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,再告诉他，我还带…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tell him I'm bringing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.04,0:34:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一头毛象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.24,0:34:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毛象？- 毛象从不单独行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A mammoth? - Mammoths never travel alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.55,0:34:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这头是例外 我要带他去「半峰」山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one does, and I'm leading him to Half Peak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.68,0:34:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧他那身肉，杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all that meat. Let's get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不行 得叫大伙儿一起上才能摆平他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet. We'll need the whole packto bring this mammoth down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.36,0:34:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家快准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get everyone ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.13,0:34:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.28,0:35:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孩子在哪儿？- 你把他丢了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the baby? - You lost it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.02,0:35:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.13,0:35:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可真丑 他可真是太可爱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so ugly. Positively adorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.93,0:35:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，小心肝你好，没毛的小家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, pumpkin. Hello, little baldy bean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.10,0:35:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪儿找到的？- 这可怜的孩子一个人在荒野里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you find it? - The poor kid, all alone in the wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.10,0:35:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,几只剑齿虎包围了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabers were closing in on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.37,0:35:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我把他 抢了过来 - 好勇敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So I just snatched him. - So brave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.64,0:35:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，是啊，他需要我我好想也能有一个自己的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, he needed me, and I only wish I had one of my own, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.35,0:35:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我…我就迷这样的男子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I find that attractive in a male.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.65,0:35:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉，谁不想要个家庭呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas. Who wouldn't wanta family, I always say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.86,0:35:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是相见恨晚 - 是啊，这可不是嘛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where've you been hiding? - Yeah, well, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.00,0:35:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小淘气，嗯？所以，正如我说的，小姐们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute kid, huh? So, as I was saying, ladies…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.93,0:36:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，嗨，曼尼.{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hi, Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.04,0:36:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.74,0:36:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下，小姐们，你们在这儿继续泡着，我就回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, ladies. You just keep marinating and I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.55,0:36:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,性感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sexy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.25,0:36:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他长得不怎么样 可要找个顾家的太难了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not much to look at, but it's so hard to find a family guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.52,0:36:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是嘛那些细腻的都被吃光了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about it.All the sensitive ones get eaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.96,0:36:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，曼尼，我求你了我需要他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Manny, please, I'm begging you. I need him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.26,0:36:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么，小帅哥还用泡妞？- 得了，你别寒碜我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A good-Looking guy like you? - You say that, but you don't mean it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.17,0:36:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我当真，瞧瞧你那两个小姐都被你迷晕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, seriously. Look at you.Those ladies, they don't stand a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.54,0:36:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这幽默感还真刻毒 - 我不想搅你的好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have a cruel sense of humor.- Don't let me cramp your style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.11,0:36:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢，曼尼，真够哥们 - 别带孩子去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, Manny. You're a pal. - Without Pinky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.28,0:36:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny, I need him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.18,0:36:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐们，说到哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, ladies, where were we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.52,0:36:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔 - 镇静，弗兰克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl. - Easy, Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.92,0:37:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见漂亮妞，他就象头猎豹至于那老虎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty tail walks by, suddenly he moves like a cheetah. And that tiger…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.33,0:37:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那「跟踪大师」连树懒都找不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Mr Great Tracker.Can't even find a sloth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.20,0:37:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成什么了？奶妈？你在看什么，小捣蛋？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am l? The wet nurse?What are you looking at, bone bag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.31,0:37:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你，你会长成一个大猛兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you. You're gonna grow into a great predator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.48,0:37:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼，我看不会，你有什么只有一撮毛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so. What have you got?You got a little patch of fur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.91,0:37:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有尖牙，没有利爪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fangs, no claws.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.55,0:37:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的皮和肉是那么…软绵绵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're folds of skin wrapped in mush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.32,0:37:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么可怕的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so threatening about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.16,0:37:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，这不是「动物园」里摸小动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this look likea petting zoo to you? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.07,0:37:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，耍小聪明？该罚你坐一会儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. All right, wise guy.You just earned a time-Out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.51,0:37:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，你觉得好玩？那这个呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's funny? How about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.75,0:37:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,猫头鹰会吃了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be a little snack for the owls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.25,0:37:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这小鬼还挺勇敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a brave little squirt, I'll give you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.39,0:38:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank goodness. Thank goodness.No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.60,0:38:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有…老虎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tiger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.20,0:38:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help. Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.83,0:38:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孩子在哪儿？- 他没事，曼尼带着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the baby? - Manfred has him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.10,0:38:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快「咬」住我 快，他咬住我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just put me in your mouth.Come on. Hurry up. He got me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.21,0:38:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.41,0:38:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你别来烦我 - 他往这边跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get away from me.- It went this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.81,0:38:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.82,0:38:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 老虎抢先得手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl. The tiger beat us to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.76,0:38:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.33,0:38:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，他的确死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.87,0:38:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,食肉动物就是开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carnivores have all the fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.67,0:38:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想那么伤他们的心 我是迫不得已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh, I hate breaking their hearts like that. But you know how it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.15,0:39:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，谢谢，可以把我放下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, thanks. You can put me down now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.42,0:39:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼，曼尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny. Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.92,0:39:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是急着赶路吗？迭戈，把他吐出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I thought we were in a hurry.And Diego, spit that out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.92,0:39:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别弄脏了嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know where it's been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.09,0:39:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈呀，刚才有一会儿 我还以为你真要吃了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy. For a second there, I thought you were gonna eat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.93,0:39:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不吃烂杂碎 - 我还以为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't eat junk food.- Thought you were gonna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.13,0:39:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真以为你…你想吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were gonna… Were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.41,0:39:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我，慢点，慢点你们能等我一下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, wait up. Wait up. Come on, come on. Can you wait a second, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.31,0:39:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.75,0:39:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.92,0:39:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,3、2、1{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.55,0:39:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实挺「忠诚」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure is faithful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.51,0:39:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再闹，我就要火了 - 是他引起的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't make me reach back. - He started it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.77,0:40:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管谁引起的，再闹就罚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care who started it. I'll finish it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.88,0:40:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现代建筑，撑不了多久的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Modern architecture. It'll never last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.16,0:40:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨哟，曼尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.13,0:40:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，迭戈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Diego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.24,0:41:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，希德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.71,0:41:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你迷路了？- 没有，我很清楚我们在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're lost. - No. I know exactly where we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.55,0:41:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他指指方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him directions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.98,0:41:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不要他指方向 - 算了，我来问他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't need directions. - Fine, I'll ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.79,0:41:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，伙计你看见有人类经过吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy. You see any humans go by here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.50,0:41:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢猜字 我喜欢猜字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love this game. I love this game. OK, OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.50,0:41:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个字，第一个字呃… 「跺」 不 「踩」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three words. First word.Stomp. No, no. Stamp, stamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.07,0:41:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜… 「群」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me try. Pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.37,0:41:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜得好，曼尼 「一群」长牙…和爪子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one, Manny.Pack of long teeth and claws.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.11,0:41:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群狼？一群…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack of wolves? Pack of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.21,0:41:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，一群熊！一群跳蚤？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack of bears? Pack of fleas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.02,0:41:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群胡须？一群…鼻子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack of whiskers? Pack of noses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.52,0:41:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 厚皮动物？- 一群谎言！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pachyderm? - Pack of lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.89,0:41:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群麻烦！一群打手！一群鸟！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack of troubles. Pack a wallop.Pack of birds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.09,0:41:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群飞鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack of flying fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.86,0:42:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！好消息！我找到一条近路！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great news. I found a shortcut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.26,0:42:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么近路？- 就是走着要比走长路快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean, shortcut? - I mean faster than the long way around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.80,0:42:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道什么叫「近路」！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what a shortcut is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.67,0:42:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们穿过去就能比人类先到「冰川道」不然就会错过他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either we beat the humans to Glacier Passor we take the long way and miss 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.21,0:43:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过那儿？你把我当什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through there? What do you take me for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.81,0:43:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天这个时候 你就可以自由了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time tomorrow, you could be a free mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.68,0:43:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或继续做保姆玩「躲躲猫」 我是不会腻的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a nanny. I never get tired of peekaboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.55,0:43:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们，瞧这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys. Guys. Check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.75,0:43:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,老虎找到一条近路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid, the tiger found a shortcut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.39,0:43:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，谢谢，我想活命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks. I choose life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.59,0:43:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我建议你最好还是走近路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I suggest you take the shortcut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.30,0:43:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在威胁我吗？- 走，树懒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you threatening me? - Move, sloth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.17,0:43:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的，老虎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to go, tiger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.71,0:43:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快进去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick. Get inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.93,0:44:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，那就走近路吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I vote shortcut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.15,0:44:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，伙计们，都跟紧些这儿很容易走丢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, stick together.It's easy to get lost in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.44,0:44:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.86,0:44:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鱼儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.20,0:45:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟上，行不行？看住一个宝宝已经够难的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you keep up, please?Hard enough to keep track of one baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.58,0:46:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…抓住你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.30,0:46:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长，前方有冰山！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, iceberg ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.24,0:47:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.63,0:47:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想玩第二回合？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Who's up for round two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.40,0:48:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫…叫…叫孩子小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the kid to be more careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.75,0:48:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧，瞧，老虎，瞧啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, look. Tigers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.65,0:48:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，没事的，没事的瞧，老虎和羚羊在做游戏捉到摸一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's OK, it's OK. Look, the tigers are just playing tag with the antelope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.46,0:48:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用牙摸 - 来吧，希德，我们也来玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With their teeth. - Come on, Sid, let's play tag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.06,0:49:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你捉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.30,0:49:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊…好吧，好吧哪儿画着树懒？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. OK, OK, OK, where are the sloths?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.57,0:49:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面怎么没画树懒？你们注意到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never see any sloths.Have you ever noticed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.54,0:49:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞧，曼尼，一头毛象噢 - 我可真兴奋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, Manny, a mammoth. - Somebody pinch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.54,0:49:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，这头胖的看上去可真象你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, this fat one looks just like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.31,0:49:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有家庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's got a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.72,0:49:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很幸福瞧，他在陪孩子玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's happy.Look, he's playing with his kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.19,0:49:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧，曼尼，这就是你的问题毛象应该象他们那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? That's your problem.That's what mammoths are supposed to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.42,0:49:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,找头母象…生一头毛象宝宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find a she-Mmoth, have baby mammoths…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.15,0:49:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.01,0:49:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干嘛？- 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.52,0:49:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.27,0:53:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快瞧啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.57,0:53:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老虎没带错路 这是「半峰山」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tiger actually did it. There's Half Peak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.74,0:53:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一站，冰川道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next stop, Glacier Pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.81,0:53:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真不该怀疑你 - 你听见吗，小家伙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How could I ever have doubted you? - Did you hear that, little fella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.68,0:53:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快到家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're almost home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.49,0:53:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的脚在冒汗 - 你身体每出现一个反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My feet are sweating. - Do we need a news flash{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.09,0:53:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都得发布新闻？- 他要我们注意他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Every time your body does something? - Lgnore him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.60,0:53:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的我的脚真的很烫！噢，噢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously. My feet are really hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.51,0:53:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的肚子在叫吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me that was your stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.91,0:53:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘，我肯定是那是雷声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it was just thunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.44,0:53:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音…来自…地下？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From underground?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.60,0:54:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，跟我一起跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, keep up with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.84,0:54:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你原地不动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would if you were moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.01,0:54:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但愿我也能跳 - 成全你了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wish I could jump like that.- Wish granted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.58,0:54:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快！跑快点！- 难道你没看到熔岩流吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, move faster. - Have you noticed the river of lava?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.21,0:54:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱紧他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold Pinky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.77,0:55:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.35,0:55:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼，你没事吧？求你说点什么，什么都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny, Manny, Manny, you OK?Come on, come on, say something. Anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.43,0:55:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？什么？我听不清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What? I can't hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.66,0:55:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站在我的鼻子上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're standing on my trunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.97,0:55:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊，你没事！你没事 - 你为什么那么干？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're OK. You're OK.- Why did you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.47,0:55:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冒死…救了我的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have died, trying to save me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.64,0:55:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家是一个集体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you do in a herd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.31,0:55:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,得互相照顾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look out for each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.65,0:55:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.12,0:56:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知你们怎么想，可我觉得我们这「集体」是最怪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about you guys, but we are the weirdest herd I've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.01,0:56:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爪子都快等不及要撕烂那毛象了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to getmy claws in that mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.18,0:56:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不能碰那毛象除非我先得到…孩子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one touches the mammoth until I get that baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.35,0:56:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先，我要把那毛象撕开扯烂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, I'll slice its hindquarters into sections.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.09,0:56:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把白色肉放一堆，深色… - 嘿，别再说了！我饿坏了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll put the white meat in one pile and… - Knock it off. I'm starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.39,0:56:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,肩膀的肉…可能比较老但绝对多汁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next, the shoulders. Occasionally tough, but extremely juicy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.19,0:56:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警告过你了，别再说了！- 省点力气吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you to knock it off. - Save your energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.50,0:56:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要杀毛象谈何容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mammoths don't go down easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.77,0:56:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.20,0:56:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先，得把他逼上死角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, you have to force it into a corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.61,0:56:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断他的退路等你们三个把他困住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut off its retreat.And when you three have it trapped, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.68,0:57:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就咬断他的喉咙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go for the throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.72,0:57:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们，别让孩子吹着风！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we gotta get this kid outta the wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.80,0:57:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有多远？- 三英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much further? - Three miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.16,0:57:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我累坏了，我们早上能到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm beat. We'll get there in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.67,0:57:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？- 我让树懒…名垂千古{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I'm putting sloths on the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.21,0:57:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那得画得现实点画他在睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you make it realistic and draw him lying down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.48,0:57:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,画得「圆」一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And make him rounder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.09,0:57:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好极了哈！- 我真笑不出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Perfect. - I forgot how to laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.30,0:57:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个天才{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.07,0:58:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起，你们得称呼我「希德火焰之王」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on you'll have torefer to me as Sid, Lord of the Flame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.11,0:58:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，火焰之王，你尾巴着火了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord of the Flame, your tail's on fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.62,0:58:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，谢谢，从现在起我就管你叫…「迭戈」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. From now on, I'm gonna call you Diego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.72,0:58:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「摸我你是死定之王」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord of "Touch Me and You're Dead".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.13,0:58:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说着玩的你这没头脑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just kidding, you little knucklehead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.80,0:58:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，小俩口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovebirds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.13,0:58:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.14,0:58:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直…太神了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.65,0:58:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来，小家伙过来，你这小虫虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you little biped.Come here, you little wormy-Worm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.76,0:58:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,到希德叔叔这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to Uncle Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.06,0:58:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边，这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no… This way. This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.20,0:59:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，去他那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No, go to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.97,0:59:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.44,0:59:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.11,0:59:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好，接着…练习吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job. Keep practicing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.75,0:59:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快瞧啊，我们的小家伙在长大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that. Our little guy is growing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.22,0:59:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，过来该睡了，肉团儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on. Sleep time, lumpy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.93,0:59:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对孩子就是亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that big pushover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.60,0:59:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道，迭戈我还没有能冒死救我的朋友呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Diego, I've never hada friend who would risk his life for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.47,0:59:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，曼尼他…他真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Manny's… he's a good guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.14,0:59:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，的确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.88,0:59:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.45,1:00:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我给你弄干净，你这么又脏又臭的回去，你老爸会怎么说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you all cleaned up. What's your daddy gonna say if you go back all stinky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.85,1:00:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来擦干净，嗯，好多了这儿还有点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just clean that up.That looks good. A little bit here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.02,1:00:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 擦干净真漂亮，小家伙 - 他长得越来越象我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You clean up nice, little fella. - I think he's starting to look like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.93,1:00:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，迭戈，你说呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego, what do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.73,1:00:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许不该送回去 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe we shouldn't do this. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.23,1:00:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他长大后会成为猎人你说他会猎杀谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we save him, he'll be a hunter.And who do you think he'll hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.24,1:00:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许救了他他就不会成猎人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe because we save him, he won't hunt us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.84,1:00:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，也许他会长出毛和长脖然叫你「妈妈」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and maybe he'll grow fur anda long skinny neck and call you Mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.88,1:01:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么回事？- 没什么，我们走，冻死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your problem? - Nothing. Let's go. I'm freezing my tail off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.57,1:01:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，迭戈，你被冻住了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego. You frozen back there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.98,1:01:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 低下身子！- 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get down. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.05,1:01:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘘，低下身跟我走 - 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get down and follow me. - What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.41,1:01:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在半峰山脚下有个埋伏…等着你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the bottom of Half Peak, there's an ambush waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.52,1:01:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你说什么「埋伏」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What do you mean, "ambush"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.06,1:01:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你设了圈套！- 那是我的任务！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You set us up.- It was my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.29,1:01:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得把孩子抢到手，可是… - 你把我们带回家当晚餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was to get the baby, but then… - You brought us home for dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.00,1:01:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行了！你被开除了！- 真对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it. You're out of the herd. - I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.87,1:01:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宰了你…你再后悔吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not. Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.14,1:01:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着，我能帮你们 - 跟紧了，希德 我们能杀出去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen, I can help you. - Stay close, Sid. We can fight our way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.01,1:01:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！他们太强大了你们得信任我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't. The pack's too strong.You have to trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.28,1:02:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,信任你？我们干嘛要信任你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust you? Why in the world would we trust you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.65,1:02:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们只有靠我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm your only chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.30,1:02:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗，「小姐」们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.20,1:02:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞧谁终于肯露脸了 - 迭戈，我正为你担心呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look who decided to show up. - Diego, I was beginning to worry about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.80,1:02:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不着担心，再过两分钟你将从…复仇中…得到满足{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to worry. In about two minutesyou'll be satisfying your taste for revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.18,1:02:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这非常好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.28,1:02:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见树懒了！孩子在他手里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the sloth. And he's got the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.45,1:02:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见到毛象就别暴露你们自己我们得出其不意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give away your positions until yousee the mammoth. He's the one to surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.06,1:02:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想重拳出击对吗，齐克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to maul something, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.62,1:02:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想出击 - 那你还等什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanna maul. - Then what are you waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.23,1:02:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我说了等那毛象出现！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I said wait for the mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.79,1:03:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,「雪板挠背」你们吃白雪吧！嘿嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Backscratcher. Eat my powder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.57,1:03:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,唷！喔！「环滑车」呃，啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loop-De-Loop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.68,1:03:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,障碍滑雪，障碍滑雪，宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slalom! Slalom, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.47,1:04:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，伙计们他被冻成小雪人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, fellas. He got a little frostbite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.98,1:04:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜！宰了他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.05,1:04:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,大惊喜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.06,1:04:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，跟我来！我们去找希德，然后离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, follow me. We'll pick up Sidand get outta here while we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.83,1:04:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，迭戈我们把这毛象摆平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Diego, let's bring this mammoth down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.18,1:04:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.51,1:04:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，宝宝在哪儿啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Where's the baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.89,1:05:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就叫…适者…生存！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival of the fittest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.26,1:05:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这老虎不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.24,1:05:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这是干嘛？- 不许 碰这 毛象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Leave the mammoth alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.68,1:05:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我先把你摆平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. I'll take you down first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.69,1:06:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.44,1:06:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经是多棒的集体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were some team, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.98,1:07:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是？胡说，我们还是一个集体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were? Come on, we're still a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.78,1:07:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设下圈套，真对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I set you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.85,1:07:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就算恨你，也懒得记仇了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me, I'm too lazy to hold a grudge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.06,1:07:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，别闹，小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock it off, squirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.06,1:07:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得强壮些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.46,1:07:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得照顾曼福雷德和希德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to take care of Manfred and Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.80,1:07:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是希德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.93,1:07:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了，你能挺过来，你是老虎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you can lick this. You're a tiger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.87,1:07:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能背你，你说怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'll carry you.Come on, what do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.14,1:07:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作点，迭戈，振作！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Diego, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.48,1:07:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他他会好的，曼尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him he's going to be OK, Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.21,1:07:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，你们别管我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you have to leave me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.99,1:07:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果人类过了「冰川道」你们就找不到他们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If those humans get through the pass, you'll never catch them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.82,1:07:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用救我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.99,1:07:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一个集体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you do in a herd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.49,1:11:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.66,1:11:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.00,1:11:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会忘了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't forget about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.41,1:11:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见，再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.18,1:12:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见，再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.71,1:12:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希德 - 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sid… - Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.48,1:12:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.19,1:12:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，对，没错宝宝在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Where's the baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.76,1:12:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，希德，我们去南方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sid, let's head south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.34,1:12:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.41,1:12:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,省口气吧，希德人类不会说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your breath, Sid.You know humans can't talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.42,1:12:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈？你没事！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego? You're OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.62,1:12:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有九条命呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine lives, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.99,1:12:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.69,1:12:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲亲你！呀！呜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could kiss ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.43,1:12:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来，搭挡，要我背吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, partner. Wanna lift?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.80,1:12:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，谢谢我得保住仅存的那点尊严{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No thanks. I gotta save whatever dignity I've got left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.94,1:13:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我们混在一块了就别管什么尊严了吧，就背我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hanging out with us. Dignity'sgot nothing to do with it. I'll take that lift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.81,1:13:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好，爬上来吧 - 托我一把，咿哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, climb aboard. - Pick me up, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.04,1:13:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者不说「驾」，随你喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mush. Or not mush. Either way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.78,1:13:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是我最棒的一次迁徙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be the best migration ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.49,1:13:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你们去我的宝地，我毛里的真菌干死后我会变成棕色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you my favorite watering holes.I turn brown when the fungus in my fur dries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.49,1:13:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这真有意思 - 我说，这「冰川时代」可真没劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Attractive. - This whole lce age thing is getting old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.39,1:13:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我喜欢什么「全球变暖」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I could go for?Global warming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.83,1:13:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做梦去吧 - 我可是说真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep dreaming. - No, really…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.71,1:13:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,两万年以后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}20, 000 Years Later{\r}
